{"id":27,"titleZh":"音乐厅里的爵士乐","titleEn":"Jazz in the Concert Hall","date":"1964-03-11","dateZh":"1964 年 3 月 11 日","concepts":"第三潮流、即时对话与倾听、古典与爵士合流","thesis":"吹出准确的高音或带滑音的弱音器都不算真正懂爵士——学会闭嘴倾听同伴并实时互相回应，才是爵士乐的灵魂。","plain":"长期以来美国古典交响和爵士乐各行其道，直到冈瑟·舒勒倡导结合两者的“第三潮流”。这一集伯恩斯坦把交响乐团的排练严规暂时放一边，先看小号男孩学习什么叫爵士，再让正规交响乐手现场加入即时即兴。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦让出指挥台请冈瑟·舒勒执棒，自己下台担任旁白，携手五位顶级爵士乐手首演“爵士版《彼得与狼》”——《爵士之旅》，示范主角从照本宣科到真正懂得“与人合奏对话”的三次试奏转变。","请出科普兰本人亲自坐琴弹奏他 1927 年写就的爵士风格钢琴协奏曲；压轴演奥斯汀新作时，爱乐弦乐与管乐甚至数次被点名打破乐谱，与爵士乐手现场同台即兴。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1Ua411A7ZV","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ua411A7ZV","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐厅里的爵士乐","duration":"53:25","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/jazz-in-the-concert-hall","repertoire":[{"composer":"Gunther Schuller","piece":"Journey into Jazz (Narr. Nat Hentoff)","titleZh":"爵士之旅","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Gunther%20Schuller%20Journey%20into%20Jazz+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Gunther%20Schuller%20Journey%20into%20Jazz"},{"composer":"Copland","piece":"Concerto for Piano and Orchestra (1926)","titleZh":"钢琴协奏曲（科普兰亲奏）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Copland%20Concerto%20for%20Piano%20and%20Orchestra+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Copland%20Concerto%20for%20Piano%20and%20Orchestra"},{"composer":"Larry Austin","piece":"Improvisations for Orchestra and Jazz Soloists","titleZh":"管弦乐与爵士独奏家即兴曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Larry%20Austin%20Improvisations%20for%20Orchestra%20and%20Jazz%20Soloists+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"http